      "caption_source": null,
      "caption_locator": null,
      "content": "1. **Draft Model + Target Model**\n   Draft Model 自回归生成 `x_{t+1}, x_{t+2}, x_{t+3}`；Target Model 把整段候选一次性 Forward，并行计算各位置概率，逐个 Accept/Reject。只要 Draft 足够轻且与 Target 分布接近，一次 Target Forward 就能接受多个 Token。",
      "truncated": false,
      "metadata": {
        "collection": "community",
        "document_id": "JennyMa11.github.io/infra/inference_accel_handbook_zh.md",
        "url": "https://github.com/JennyMa11/JennyMa11.github.io/blob/188467456afaff48887869462951a1b5457c0387/infra/inference_accel_handbook_zh.md",
